  "title": { "en": "Food and drinks", "uz": "Ovqat va ichimliklar", "ru": "Еда и напитки", "tr": "Yiyecek ve içecekler" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Order food and drinks and say what you like.",
    "uz": "Ovqat va ichimlik buyurtma qiling, nimani yoqtirishingizni ayting.",
    "ru": "Закажите еду и напитки и скажите, что вам нравится.",
    "tr": "Yiyecek ve içecek sipariş et, neyi sevdiğini söyle."
  },
  "guide": "rocky",
  "color": "#EF4444",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "I like, he likes", "uz": "I like, he likes", "ru": "I like, he likes", "tr": "I like, he likes" },
    "body": {
      "en": "With I, you, we and they the verb stays the same: I like tea. With he, she or one person add -s: She likes tea. For a question use \"Do\": Do you like fish? For \"no\" use \"do not\" (don't): I do not like meat.",
      "uz": "I, you, we, they bilan fe'l o'zgarmaydi: I like tea. He, she yoki bitta odam bilan -s qo'shiladi: She likes tea. Savol \"Do\" bilan boshlanadi: Do you like fish? Inkor uchun \"do not\" (don't): I do not like meat.",
      "ru": "С I, you, we, they глагол не меняется: I like tea. С he, she или одним человеком добавляется -s: She likes tea. Вопрос начинается с \"Do\": Do you like fish? Отрицание — \"do not\" (don't): I do not like meat.",
      "tr": "I, you, we, they ile fiil değişmez: I like tea. He, she ya da tek bir kişiyle -s eklenir: She likes tea. Soru \"Do\" ile başlar: Do you like fish? Olumsuzluk için \"do not\" (don't): I do not like meat."
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I like apples.", "native": { "uz": "Men olmani yoqtiraman.", "ru": "Мне нравятся яблоки.", "tr": "Ben elma severim." } },
      { "en": "She likes fruit.", "native": { "uz": "U mevani yoqtiradi.", "ru": "Ей нравятся фрукты.", "tr": "O meyve sever." } },
      { "en": "I do not like meat.", "native": { "uz": "Men go'shtni yoqtirmayman.", "ru": "Мне не нравится мясо.", "tr": "Ben et sevmem." } }
    ]
  },
